    尿 | niào | urine; pass water | Has 水 (water) inside 尸 instead of 毛
    屎 | shǐ | excrement; feces | Has 米 (rice) inside 尸 instead of 毛
    色 | sè | color; expression; form | Has 刀 above 巴 instead of standalone 巴
    把 | bǎ | grasp; handle; classifier | Has hand radical 扌 next to 巴
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
